[Auto Weapons - Full Set]
author=IRISHDEVELOPERDEV (custom, game's own CCheat::WeaponCheat2 0x59E070 + WeaponCheat3 0x59E350, called from a hook on the CCheat::DoCheats call in CGame::Process at 0x2434CC)
description=[TESTED] [CODE CAVE + HOOK] Gives CJ a full weapon set automatically: chainsaw, satchel charges, silenced pistol, SPAS-12, MP5, M4, sniper rifle, heat-seeking RPG and fire extinguisher. Checks every 3 seconds and re-gives them whenever CJ's heavy-weapon slot is empty (new game, after Wasted/Busted, or a save without one). No buttons needed. Uses a code cave at 0x000FF000-0x000FF06C, counter at 0x000FE000, hook at 0x002434CC.
